				<q>Certainly.</q>
				<time datetime="1938-03-24">03/24/1938</time>
			</li>
		
			<li class=" bubble " tabindex="0">
				<span class="name">Costello</span>
				<q>Who’s playing first?</q>
				<time datetime="1938-03-24">03/24/1938</time>
			</li>
		
			<li class=" bubble me " tabindex="0">
				<span class="name">Abbott</span>
				<q>That’s right.</q>
				<time datetime="1938-03-24">03/24/1938</time>
			</li>
		<li class="action">Costello becomes exasperated.</li>
			<li class=" bubble " tabindex="0">
				<span class="name">Costello</span>
				<q>When you pay off the first baseman every month, who gets the money?</q>
				<time datetime="1938-03-24">03/24/1938</time>
			</li>
		
			<li class=" bubble me " tabindex="0">
				<span class="name">Abbott</span>
